{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"card":1,"entry":2,"missions":33,"alongside":37,"kin":42,"engines":67,"usedOn":68,"sites":69,"crewed":74,"museums":75,"hero":76},null,{"id":3,"name":4,"category":5,"agency":6,"country":7,"manufacturer":8,"first_flight":9,"status":10,"era":11,"epoch":12,"best_known_for":13,"credit":14,"links":15,"linked_missions":28,"linked_sites":29,"tagline":13,"description":32},"beresheet","Beresheet","lander","SpaceIL","Israel","IAI / SpaceIL","2019-04-11","FAILED","2011-now","commercial-era","首次私人月球着陆尝试","Skeleton entry for /fleet (PRD-012 v0.2 / Phase A scaffold). Builder + agency + first-flight per public sources. Specs and gallery TBD in later phases.",[16,20,24],{"l":17,"u":18,"t":19},"Beresheet — Wikipedia","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beresheet","intro",{"l":21,"u":22,"t":23},"Beresheet — NASA NSSDCA","https://nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov/nmc/spacecraft/display.action?id=2019-009B","core",{"l":25,"u":26,"t":27},"SpaceIL Beresheet final report (Wikipedia)","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beresheet#Mission_failure","deep",[3],[30],{"type":31,"site_id":3},"moon","首次私人月球着陆尝试，由以色列非营利组织SpaceIL实施。2019年4月，惯性测量单元（IMU）陀螺仪故障引发计算机反复重启，每次重启都会令发动机关机；等到恢复控制时，着陆器已离月面太近、速度太快，无法幸存。这次任务证明，在月球着陆远比抵达月球困难。",[34],{"id":3,"name":4,"first":35,"year":36},"首个抵达月球的私人出资任务；以色列首次月球任务",2019,[38],{"id":39,"name":40,"tagline":41},"falcon-9","Falcon 9 Block 5","可重复使用的助推器重塑了商业发射",[43,47,51,55,59,63],{"id":44,"name":45,"tagline":46},"change-4","嫦娥四号","月球最远处第一次软着陆",{"id":48,"name":49,"tagline":50},"vikram-cy2","Vikram (Chandrayaan-2)","印度Chandrayaan-2的着陆器；2019年坠毁，但轨道器继续运行",{"id":52,"name":53,"tagline":54},"change-5","嫦娥五号","自1976年以来首次月球样本返回",{"id":56,"name":57,"tagline":58},"insight","InSight","火星地震仪；已探测到1300多次火星地震",{"id":60,"name":61,"tagline":62},"schiaparelli","Schiaparelli","ExoMars先驱；经验教训用于Rosalind Franklin",{"id":64,"name":65,"tagline":66},"hakuto-r","Hakuto-R计划","日本首批私人登月尝试；任务1（2023年）和任务2（2025年）均坠毁",[],[],[70],{"type":31,"href":71,"name":4,"place":72,"text":73},"/moon/beresheet","澄海","首次私人资助的月球着陆尝试——以色列非营利组织 SpaceIL 的 585 公斤着陆器。抵达月球轨道，但在下降过程中陀螺仪失效导致发动机关闭，以约 950 米/秒（接近 1 km/s）的速度撞击月面。携带刻在镍片上的人类知识\"月球图书馆\"，以及缓步动物样本——能够进行隐生现象的极端耐受生物——这些生物可能在撞击中存活，也可能未能幸存。启发了 Beresheet 2（计划中）的研发。",[],[],"/orrery/images/fleet-galleries/beresheet/03.webp"],"uses":{"params":["id"]}}]}
